    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future War Tactics: SOF vs Alien Invasion \u2013 Turn-Based Strategy</strong> is a single-player turn-based strategy game where you lead a Special Operations Forces (SOF) unit in a fight against a mysterious alien threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MYSTERIOUS DISAPPEARANCES AND ANOMALIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The events unfold in the near future. In the Ural Federal District, mass disappearances of people are occurring, accompanied by geomagnetic disturbances and strange atmospheric phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/a0d7145e014e874995d0791e9d5d4232.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/a0d7145e014e874995d0791e9d5d4232.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/a0d7145e014e874995d0791e9d5d4232.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE SOF COMMANDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are assigned to investigate the incident sites and uncover the reasons behind what\u2019s happening. But the mission takes a darker turn when unknown creatures launch an attack on your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/835c33c61920d5d1fa7dca9388a8707a.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/835c33c61920d5d1fa7dca9388a8707a.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/835c33c61920d5d1fa7dca9388a8707a.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO ARE THESE CREATURES?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll have to uncover who these aliens are, where they came from, why they are abducting people and stealing weapons \u2014 and how to fight them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/5efda5019203f7f0ab16e424328e746c.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/5efda5019203f7f0ab16e424328e746c.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/5efda5019203f7f0ab16e424328e746c.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL COMBAT AND STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different combinations of weapons and abilities, build your tactics \u2014 every decision you make can impact not just the mission, but the fate of all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take command, uncover the truth, and fight back against the invaders. The future is in your hands.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future War Tactics: SOF vs Alien Invasion \u2013 Turn-Based Strategy</strong> is a single-player turn-based strategy game where you lead a Special Operations Forces (SOF) unit in a fight against a mysterious alien threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MYSTERIOUS DISAPPEARANCES AND ANOMALIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The events unfold in the near future. In the Ural Federal District, mass disappearances of people are occurring, accompanied by geomagnetic disturbances and strange atmospheric phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/a0d7145e014e874995d0791e9d5d4232.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/a0d7145e014e874995d0791e9d5d4232.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/a0d7145e014e874995d0791e9d5d4232.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE SOF COMMANDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are assigned to investigate the incident sites and uncover the reasons behind what\u2019s happening. But the mission takes a darker turn when unknown creatures launch an attack on your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/835c33c61920d5d1fa7dca9388a8707a.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/835c33c61920d5d1fa7dca9388a8707a.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/835c33c61920d5d1fa7dca9388a8707a.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO ARE THESE CREATURES?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll have to uncover who these aliens are, where they came from, why they are abducting people and stealing weapons \u2014 and how to fight them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/5efda5019203f7f0ab16e424328e746c.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/5efda5019203f7f0ab16e424328e746c.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/5efda5019203f7f0ab16e424328e746c.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL COMBAT AND STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different combinations of weapons and abilities, build your tactics \u2014 every decision you make can impact not just the mission, but the fate of all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.poster.avif?t=1754055836\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.webm?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680900/extras/f1dd35031b63c6f3b27a0701735855d2.mp4?t=1754055836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take command, uncover the truth, and fight back against the invaders. The future is in your hands.</strong></p>",
